---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<script>
if (!sessionStorage.getItem('sthenos_auth')) {
  window.location.href = '/';
}
</script>

<Layout title="Architectural Comparison - Sthenos">
  <nav>
    <a href="/">Sthenos</a>
    <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="section black-bg">
    <div class="content">
      <p class="label">Architectural Comparison</p>
      <h1>THEON + Twin Prime vs sthenos.cloud</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Marketing vs. Engineering Reality</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MAIN COMPARISON TABLE -->
  <section class="section black-bg">
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Stack Comparison</h2>
      <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table class="comparison-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Layer</th>
              <th>THEON + Twin Prime (implied)</th>
              <th>sthenos.cloud (system scope)</th>
              <th>Key Divergence</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td class="row-label">Primary Goal</td>
              <td>Operational AI embedded in defense products</td>
              <td>Adaptive inference + enrichment + behavioral/probabilistic modeling</td>
              <td>Product vs. meta-system</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="row-label">Core Paradigm</td>
              <td>Multimodal sensor fusion → AI reasoning → operator output</td>
              <td>Probabilistic inference + coherence + uncertainty-aware state evolution</td>
              <td>Deterministic output vs. belief dynamics</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="row-label">Model Role</td>
              <td>Embedded decision-support model</td>
              <td>Component inside evolving inference/control loop</td>
              <td>Static inference vs. dynamic system</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="row-label">Uncertainty Handling</td>
              <td>Thresholding / confidence scores</td>
              <td>Explicit state-level uncertainty propagation (UDM/coherence coupling)</td>
              <td>Scalar confidence vs. structured uncertainty state</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="row-label">Runtime Environment</td>
              <td>Edge constrained, real-time, hardened systems</td>
              <td>Flexible compute + adaptive runtime orchestration</td>
              <td>Fixed embedded vs. adaptive execution layer</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="row-label">Failure Handling</td>
              <td>Fallback to legacy optronics modes</td>
              <td>Structural recovery bias + manifold stabilization logic</td>
              <td>Redundancy vs. active stabilization</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="row-label">Data Semantics</td>
              <td>Sensor modality fusion (image, IR, radar, etc.)</td>
              <td>Entity-centric enriched behavioral signals</td>
              <td>Raw physical signals vs. abstracted entities</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="row-label">Adaptivity</td>
              <td>Limited (model updates offline)</td>
              <td>Continuous inference adaptation</td>
              <td>Static vs. continuous learning loop</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="row-label">Control Philosophy</td>
              <td>Output-driven (recommendation/action)</td>
              <td>State-driven (belief evolution + control coupling)</td>
              <td>Action layer vs. state layer</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- KEY INSIGHT -->
  <section class="section dark-bg">
    <div class="content narrow">
      <h2>Critical Constraint</h2>
      <div class="insight-box">
        <p>The critical constraint is <strong>not model capability</strong>. It is <strong>system integration under latency, reliability, and classification constraints</strong>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="insight-box warning">
        <p>In defense systems, the bottleneck is almost always <strong>integration, certification, and operational doctrine alignment</strong>, not model intelligence.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- DOABILITY ASSESSMENT -->
  <section class="section black-bg">
    <div class="content">
      <h2>Doability Assessment</h2>
      <div class="two-col">
        <div class="col feasible">
          <h3>Technically Doable</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Offline or near-real-time multimodal fusion</li>
            <li>Edge inference on constrained hardware</li>
            <li>Decision support (not autonomous control)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="col not-feasible">
          <h3>Not Directly Doable</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Full "native reasoning" in real-time contested environments</li>
            <li>Seamless plug-in of frontier models into legacy optronics</li>
            <li>Safe deployment without domain adaptation + certification</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAILURE MODE -->
  <section class="section dark-bg">
    <div class="content narrow">
      <h2>Single-Point Failure Mode</h2>
      <div class="failure-box">
        <p><strong>Latency + Reliability Mismatch</strong></p>
        <p>If inference exceeds strict timing budgets or degrades under partial sensor loss:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>System gets disabled (mission failure)</li>
          <li>OR downgraded to legacy pipeline (AI becomes unused overhead)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="quote">"Works in lab, bypassed in field."</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>UNCLASSIFIED // FOR OFFICIAL USE ONLY</p>
    <p class="ownership">The domain <strong>sthenos.cloud</strong> and all associated site content are held in trust and will be transferred to the rightful owner(s) of Sthenos AI upon request.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  nav {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: 32px;
    padding: 24px 5%;
    z-index: 100;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.95) 0%, transparent 100%);
  }

  nav a {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.17px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--spectral-white);
  }

  nav a:hover { opacity: 0.7; }

  .section {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 100px 5% 80px;
  }

  .black-bg {
    background: #000000;
  }

  .dark-bg {
    background: #0a0a0f;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .content.narrow {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .label {
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    opacity: 0.5;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    color: var(--spectral-white);
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 18px;
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  /* TABLE */
  .table-wrapper {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .comparison-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .comparison-table th {
    text-align: left;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
    color: var(--spectral-cyan);
    background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
  }

  .comparison-table td {
    padding: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  .comparison-table tr:hover td {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
  }

  .row-label {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--spectral-cyan);
    font-size: 13px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    min-width: 150px;
  }

  .comparison-table tr td:first-child {
    color: var(--spectral-cyan);
  }

  /* INSIGHT BOX */
  .insight-box {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px 32px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .insight-box p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .insight-box.warning {
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
  }

  .insight-box strong {
    color: var(--spectral-cyan);
  }

  /* TWO COL */
  .two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .col {
    padding: 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .col.feasible {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.2);
  }

  .col.not-feasible {
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
  }

  .col h3 {
    font-size: 14px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .col.feasible h3 { color: #10b981; }
  .col.not-feasible h3 { color: #ef4444; }

  .col ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .col li {
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .col li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  /* FAILURE BOX */
  .failure-box {
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px;
  }

  .failure-box > p:first-child {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .failure-box ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }

  .failure-box li {
    padding: 8px 0;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .failure-box li::before {
    content: "→ ";
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .failure-box .quote {
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
  }

  /* FOOTER */
  .footer {
    padding: 48px 5%;
    background: #000;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .footer p:first-child {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    opacity: 0.4;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ownership {
    font-size: 11px;
    opacity: 0.5;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ownership strong {
    color: var(--spectral-white);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .two-col { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    h1 { font-size: 28px; }
    .comparison-table { font-size: 13px; }
    .comparison-table th, .comparison-table td { padding: 12px; }
  }
</style>